==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite similar to [[4th Round: Dusk (Veteran)]], except that there is a The Face instead of Dark Emperor Nyandam and there are no Shy Boys. This difference would make this stage easier than [[4th Round: Dusk (Veteran)]] if it weren't for the increased numbers and frequencies of Gory Darks and Doge Darks spawning. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] are more needed here than in [[4th Round: Dusk (Veteran)]] in order to keep the horde of Doge Darks and Gory Darks from pushing to your base. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] helps greatly, as he outranges The Face, unlike in [[4th Round: Dusk (Veteran)]] with Dark Emperor Nyandam. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] is also helpful, but not as much as Bahamut Cat.

